":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-06T19:43:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T06:16:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124237","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124237.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124237.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nGodot's text resource loader would mistakenly mark a **loaded/reloaded** resource (from disk) as edited, which would cause it to save a newer version of the scene file with lots of default values to the disk. In my project, this was causing massive git diffs without me ever touching those files.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe binary resource loader ([ResourceLoaderBinary::load](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f3035aad5625f96b624559378acf5b86d5c32e01/core/io/resource_format_binary.cpp#L618)), already [has](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f3035aad5625f96b624559378acf5b86d5c32e01/core/io/resource_format_binary.cpp#L821) this code:\r\n```cpp\r\n#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED\r\n\t\tres->set_edited(false);\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\n\r\nthis prevents it from re-saving a just-loaded/reloaded resources back to disk. The text resource loader lacks this.\r\n\r\nThe change inside of the `core/io/resource.cpp` file also fixes the same issue but in the [hot reload path](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f3035aad5625f96b624559378acf5b86d5c32e01/core/io/resource.cpp#L263).\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124237/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124237/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}